  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Inclusion in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Somalia, a toxic mix of conflict, severe drought and floods has left the country with almost 4 million displaced people. Loop has provided a  safe, free, independent and anonymous  platform for people to report on aid diversion and human rights violations. The time has come to extend our reach to marginalised groups and excluded communities, who, tragically, remain unheard. Join us in this vital mission, for their voices deserve to be acknowledged and amplified.</narrative>
  </description>
